- const pageTitle = "What is this?"
- const assetPath = "../"
include partials/_variables
include partials/_mixins

doctype html
html(lang="en")
  include partials/_head.pug

  body.entry-page.help-page
    #app
      main.help-content
        header.help-header
          .entry-wordmark(aria-label="BINGOPE" role="img")
            include ../svg/bingope_v2.svg
          p.entry-tagline Minnesota State Fair Bingo, by Lemon
          
        .help-copy

          h1 What is this?

          p BINGOPE is a phone-friendly bingo game for the Minnesota State Fair #[sup 1]. You get a single card for the day of things to see and do. Walk around the fair and mark off squares as you see/do them.

          p I'm not gonna explain how bingo works. You already know. But as for verifying things and awarding prizes? That's between you and your group.

          p Your marks stay in this browser, on this phone. No account, no login, nothing to sync.

        a.help-play(href="../") Okay, let's play.

        .help-copy
          p.footnote #[strong 1:] That is, it was made #[em for] the Minnesota State Fair, not that's official or anything. Would it work for other situations? I dunno, maybe.

    include partials/_javascripts
